<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Pacificare, Healthsource started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Pacificare, Healthsource started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Chicago Corp healthcare analyst Peter Costa said he started PacifiCare Health Systems Inc and Healthsource Inc with buy ratings.</p>
<p>--Shares in Healthsource were up 3/8 to 12-1/2. Shares in Pacificare A were up 6-1/8 to 74-3/8; B shares were up 5-3/4 to 77-1/2.</p>
<p>--&quot;Healthsource is well positioned for continued enrollment growth in the Southeast, one of the lowest-penetrated areas in the U.S.,&quot; Costa said.</p>
<p>--&quot;Pacificare has tremendous potential with the Medicare risk contracting business and there's tremendous synergies from the merger with FHP International Corp,&quot; Costa said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
